<title>COLOMBIA: Talks well advanced on Colombia's Piedemonte block.</title>
<headline>Talks well advanced on Colombia's Piedemonte block.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delicate negotiations between British Petroleum Co Plc and Colombian state oil company Ecopetrol over the future of the Piedemonte prospect are at an advanced stage and could be completed within a month, sources at the British multinational said.</p>
<p>&quot;We have been discussing this for a long time and we're in an advanced stage. We're hopeful it will be resolved fairly quickly, within the next month,&quot; a senior source at BP's Colombian subsidiary BP Exploration said.</p>
</text>
